  "releaseNotes": "Preview 4 (breaking): all execution runs on the resumable engine. The legacy engine (IFlowEngine, IFlowPreparedStartEngine) and the IFlowApiOperation, IFlowApplicationAction and IFlowEventPublisher contracts are removed with no compatibility shim; implement IFlowResumableOperation and register AddFlowRuntimeRecovery. Default-policy failures now fault the instance and release the claim. Published preview 2 and preview 3 packages are unaffected. Migration guide: https://github.com/joelmuskwe/FlowRuntime/blob/main/docs/migration-preview4.md. Changelog: https://github.com/joelmuskwe/FlowRuntime/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
